         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nHumanity spread across the world over almost 2 million years. However, if we consider only one group of *Homo* — our own species, *Homo sapiens* — this period of expansion becomes much shorter: less than 300,000 years. The chart below shows the timeline of our closest relatives.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
