         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The Evolution of Mathematics\n\nMathematical knowledge developed independently in different places, and it was only unified over time by our species — and we have already studied these ideas in earlier classes.\n\nIn this class, we will take a tour that highlights maps and the approximate periods when each numerical system appeared, according to our current understanding. The map below shows the journey of our species across the world.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<img src=\"https://www.historytracers.org/images/Mapswire/mapswire-world-political-white-equal_earth_journey.png\">",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "*Figure 1: The journey of Homo sapiens across the world.*",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Figure 1: The journey of Homo sapiens across the world.*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
