         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### In America: The Quipus\n\nThe second counting system we learn about did not arise near the first one. The earliest evidence dates from about 5,000 years ago. Although some researchers still doubt how old the quipus are, here we follow the researchers who argue that they were already present in Caral, Peru, unless new research proves otherwise.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
