         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### In America: Practice with Quipu\n\nThe quipu is read on the vertical cords that hang from the main horizontal cord, and each knot represents a count. Add knots until the cord shows the proposed number.\n\nRepresent the proposed number with the quipu.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
