         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### In Europe: The Calculi\n\nWe cannot be sure that Caral, Peru, was the first place to make quipus, because quipus are not easy to preserve over time. The same issue happens with the abacus.\n\nFor this reason, we start our tour with the *calculi*, whose use the papers we consulted date to around <htdate0>.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [
                  {
                     "type": "gregory",
                     "year": "-300",
                     "month": "",
                     "day": ""
                  }
