               "text": "#### In Asia (India): The Hindu-Arabic Numerals\n\nWe cannot be sure when the Hindu-Arabic numerals first arose: writing systems reached India only about 2,300 years ago, though numbers may have existed before that.\n\nFor this reason, we include Hindu numerals here: they appear in the Ashoka inscriptions dated to <htdate0> and <htdate1>.",
