         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### In America: The Yupana\n\nReturning to America (Abya Yala), we know that the Incas — during the 15th and 16th centuries according to the Gregorian calendar — created a tool to do mathematics. More than that, we have evidence that the *yupana* was used together with the *quipus*.\n\nIn this app, we explore the Yupana Inka Tawa Pukllay method, developed by Dhavit Prem, to learn how to use this ancient tool.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
