         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### In Russia: The Schyoty\n\nAround <htdate0>, in Russia, another tool used to represent numbers was developed. Although some people call it an abacus, we cannot evaluate possible connections between it and the earlier abacuses we studied here.",
